:: Start {"position": "625,275", "size": "100,100"}
<h1>Welcome to Vascular Village!</h1><p>Meet Ruby, your guide on an amazing adventure inside the human body! 🔬</p><p>Follow Ruby as she explores the body's incredible systems, discovers how they work together, and learns the little things we can do every day to stay healthy.</p><p>From the heart pumping blood to the lungs bringing in oxygen, every discovery brings Ruby one step closer to understanding how our bodies keep us going!</p><p><strong>Are you ready to join Ruby and explore the wonders of Vascular Village?</strong></p>
<p class="back-link "> <<button "Let's Explore! →">><<goto "ScenarioMenu">><</button>></p>


/* MAIN HOME SCREEN  */
