/* TUTORIAL */


:: TutorialRuby
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Meet Ruby, Your Little Guide!</h2><p>Hi there! I'm Ruby! 👋</p><p>I'm a red blood cell, and I'm part of your body's amazing circulatory system.</p><p>My job is to travel around your body, carrying oxygen to the places that need it. I travel through blood vessels, pass by the heart, and visit different parts of the body every day!</p><p>During your adventure, I'll travel alongside you as we explore different body systems and discover how they work together to keep us healthy.</p><p><strong>Are you ready to explore the body with me?</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Let's Go! →">><<goto "TutorialScenario">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialScenario
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 1: Choose a Scenario</h2><p>Before we begin, let's talk about scenarios!</p><p>A scenario is a real situation that helps us understand how the human body works and how our everyday choices can affect our health.</p><p>For example, we might explore what happens inside the body when someone exercises, rests, or makes healthy lifestyle choices.</p><p>Each scenario contains several activities. By completing these activities, you'll discover how different parts of the body work together in that situation.</p><p><strong>Your mission is to explore the scenario and help me discover what is happening inside the body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialBodyMap">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialBodyMap
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 2: Explore Body Map</h2><p>Once you choose a scenario, you'll see a map of the human body.</p><p>Look for the highlighted circles! Each circle represents a body system involved in your chosen scenario and becomes dimmed when you complete an activity.</p><ul><li>🧠 Brain</li><li>🩸 Blood Cells</li><li>❤️ Heart</li><li>🩸 Blood Vessels</li><li>🫁 Lungs</li></ul><p><strong>Explore each highlighted area to uncover everything happening inside the body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialActivity">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialActivity
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 3: Complete an Activity</h2><p>When you select a body system, you'll open an activity that helps you learn more about what's happening inside the body.</p><p>Read the instructions carefully and choose the correct healthy actions or answers.</p><p>After making a choice, Ruby will give you feedback to explain why your answer is correct and what it means for the body.</p><p>Keep choosing the correct answers until you've completed all the required choices for that activity.</p><p><strong>Remember, every correct choice brings you one step closer to completing your mission!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialLessons">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialLessons
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 4: Discover What You've Learned!</h2><p>Every completed activity unlocks a special lesson that explains the important information you've discovered.</p><p>When every activity is completed, you unlock the scenario lesson, which brings everything together for a completed scenario.</p><p>Remember, you can return to unfinished scenarios and continue where you left off.</p><p><strong>Every activity is a new discovery, and every completed scenario brings you closer to understanding the amazing human body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "🏠 Start Exploring!">><<goto "ScenarioMenu">><</button>></div>
</div>


